// Sweet And Lovely (1931)

Tempo 120
Keysig C

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Groove FoxTrotIntro
Begin Solo
    Voice Organ2
    Octave 6
    Articulate 110
    Harmony OpenAbove
    Volume f
    Begin Riff
        2.g;4a;
        2a;c+;
        8d+;c+;b;a;4g;a;
        1g;
    End
End

Swingmode On  // just for the intro notes
Swell mp m 4

1         C
2        Am
3        Dm
4        G7

Groove FoxTrot
Volume m

5         C
6        C9
7        C7
8        C9      /     C7

